 ".\t\n\:0414\:0430\:043b\:0435\:0435 \:0440\:0430\:0441\:0441\:043c\:043e\
\:0442\:0440\:0438\:0442\:0435 \:043f\:0440\:043e\:0438\:0437\:0432\:0435\
\:0434\:0435\:043d\:0438\:0435 \:0432\:0441\:0435\:0445 \:0447\:0438\:0441\
\:0435\:043b \:0438\:0437 \:0441\:0442\:0440\:043e\:0447\:043a\:0438 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["a", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "47cb3954-2ecd-4e20-a916-f88ddd7e64ce"],
 " \:0442\:0430\:0431\:043b\:0438\:0446\:044b \:0443\:043c\:043d\:043e\:0436\
\:0435\:043d\:0438\:044f: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
